      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "RenektonPreExecute",
        "name": "Ruthless Predator",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Renekton slashes his target twice, dealing moderate physical damage and stuns them for 0.75 seconds. If Renekton has more than 50 Fury, he slashes his target three times, destroying damage shields on the target, dealing high physical damage, and stunning them for 1.5 seconds.",
        "bodyHtml": "Renekton's next Attack strikes twice, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> for 0.75 seconds and dealing a total of <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(10/40/70/100/130 + (150% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. Hitting a champion generates an additional <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">10 Fury</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Fury Bonus</span>: Renekton Attacks 3 times instead, destroying <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">Shields</span> before dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(15/60/105/150/195 + (225% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> for 1.5 seconds. Does not generate any <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Fury</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">All Attacks apply On-hit effects separately.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Does not break shields on monsters.</span>",
